While Frost Infusion is active, your bombs deposit a layer of ice on your golem for [6, 8, 10, 11, 12 (TL1-5; SP 100)] turns when they hit it.

This ice provides your golem with [13, 18, 22, 25, 28 (TL1-5; SP 100)] additional armour, melee attacks against it deal 0.0 Cold damage to the attacker, and 50% of its damage is converted to Cold.

The effects increase with your talent level and with the Spellpower and damage modifiers of your golem.
